{"id":"sonnette","lemma":"sonnette","pos":"noun","rank":4325,"glosses":["bell (for example, on a bicycle), handbell","doorbell","pile driver"],"ipa":"/sɔ.nɛt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e8/Fr-sonnette.ogg/Fr-sonnette.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sonnettes"},"examples":[{"text":"La sonnette ne fonctionne pas.","en":"The bellows aren't working.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to function, to work","l":"fonctionner"},{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Finalement, la sonnette retentit.","en":"Finally, the bell rang.","words":[{"g":"finally"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to ring, to ring out","l":"retentir"}]},{"text":"J'étais encore en train de manger lorsque la sonnette retentit.","en":"I was still eating when the doorbell rang.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"still"},null,null,null,{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to ring, to ring out","l":"retentir"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"in the middle of"]]}]}